{
    "_id": "spindrift",
    "name": "Spindrift",
    "instructions": "3 ounces orange juice 2 ounces fresh lemon juice 1 ounce passion fruit syrup 3/4 ounce sugar syrup 1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract 2 ounces dark jamaican rum 1 1/2 ounces demerara rum 1 ounce light rum 20 ounces crushed ice Put everything in a blender. Blend for up to 10 seconds. Pour unstrained into a large snifter.",
