    "description": "In 2005 the Spindrift was put on the menu of the Taboo Cove bar, at the Venetian Hotel in Las Vegas. Two months later Taboo Cove closed. We don’t know if the Spindrift was directly responsible, but there’s no denying that the drink takes a lot of time to make.",
